# Ikki tizimli preview uchun Cloudflare R2 (tools/handoff.sh, tools/handoff.ps1).
# Nusxa oling (.env.handoff gitignore'da) va ikkala tizimda ham bir xil to'ldiring.
#
# Kalit: Cloudflare dashboard -> R2 -> Manage API tokens -> Create API token,
# ruxsat "Object Read & Write", faqat shu bucket uchun.
R2_ACCOUNT_ID=
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
R2_BUCKET=rankwant-handoff
